msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"(...Hey, what about her? As far as being a hostess goes, she\r\n"
"might be a good fit. Let's see here...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"(She seems pretty average all around... the type that might\r\n"
"get flustered if things don't go her way. Yet there's still\r\n"
"something intriguing about her... Could she be the one?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "(On second thought... maybe not.)"
msgstr "(Ripensandoci... Magari no.)"

msgctxt "184"
msgid "(Okay, let's see what I can come up with...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Pardon me, madam."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Madam? Who are you calling a madam?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Why you, of course. All it took was one sidelong glance and\r\n"
"I knew you were our future \"Madam of the Night.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Uh-huh... That sure is a funny way to strike up a\r\n"
"conversation... But I am a bit flattered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"How would you like the chance to cultivate a new aspect of\r\n"
"yourself? I can provide you with the appropriate venue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Are you trying to recruit me or something? Don't tell me\r\n"
"you're scouting for a cabaret club..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"In fact, I am. Our club is over on Hatsumachi. Care to take\r\n"
"a look?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Well... I guess I'm not opposed to the idea. I have been\r\n"
"looking for job after job and still haven't had any luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Then please, allow me to show you to our club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Alright. Well, guess I should introduce myself... The name's\r\n"
"Ritsuko. I know I just turned 20, but I don't like to drink,\r\n"
"unless it's a strawberry mojito. Guess that's about it!"
msgstr ""

